--- spec.txt ---
I would like you to implement a module named TopModule with the following
interface. All input and output ports are one bit unless otherwise
specified.

 - input  A
 - input  B
 - input  Ci
 - output D
 - output Co

Implement a full subtractor using a 3-to-8 decoder and necessary logic
gates. In the full subtractor: A is the minuend (the number being
subtracted from), B is the subtrahend (the number being subtracted), Ci
is the borrow input from the lower bit position, D is the difference, and
Co is the borrow output to the higher bit position.

You are provided with the following 3-to-8 decoder module code, which you
should include and instantiate in your solution:

